<title>SWEDEN: Autoliv to pay dividend of $0.11/shr.</title>
<headline>Autoliv to pay dividend of $0.11/shr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car safety equipment maker Autoliv Inc said on Tuesday its board set a dividend of 11 U.S. cents per share, to be paid on September 4.</p>
<p>Autoliv said in a statement it paid a dividend four times per year with the payment date the first Thursday of September, December, March and June.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
